{"src":"es","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":192600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"es","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"commercial","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":5944.419045000001,"text":"Es más delgada bajo los mares lunares y más gruesa bajo las tierras altas."},{"kind":"text","t":6154.912677,"text":"It is thinner under lunar seas and thicker under highlands."},{"kind":"audio","t":6199.858824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6204.38991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6209.35135,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":6209.701445000001,"samples":1896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":13687.737928999999,"text":"Durante esta fase de la historia de Europa, la iglesia católica que había acumulado riqueza y poder fue cuestionada."},{"kind":"text","t":14021.524733,"text":"During this phase of European history, the Catholic Church, which had accumulated wealth and power, was challenged."},{"kind":"audio","t":14062.85824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14067.464355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":14072.863619,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14078.250203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14083.47695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14086.225870999999,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":20456.542051,"text":"También debe visitar hacia el norte el gran santuario Nuestra Señora de Fátima, santuario"},{"kind":"text","t":20781.894164,"text":"You should also visit the great sanctuary of Our Lady of Fatima to the north, a sanctuary."},{"kind":"audio","t":20836.880739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20842.058806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20847.355872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20852.531809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20854.837616,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":25541.599271,"text":"que es un sitio donde hubo apariciones de la Virgen María, famosas en todo el mundo."},{"kind":"text","t":25854.674368,"text":"which is a place where apparitions of the Virgin Mary took place, famous throughout the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":25902.668411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25907.512403,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25912.738939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":25917.927766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25920.997363,"samples":22528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":34676.674784,"text":"Según ha informado la Agencia Nuclear de Japón, se ha encontrado cesio y yodo radioactivos en la planta."},{"kind":"text","t":35001.968048,"text":"According to Japan’s Nuclear Agency, radioactive cesium and iodine have been detected at the plant."},{"kind":"audio","t":35042.536256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35047.562005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":35052.675813,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":490,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35057.971568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35063.419241999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35066.36513,"samples":22160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":47822.413863,"text":"Según la información que se filtró, el documento tratará sobre el conflicto fronterizo que Palestina pretende resolver basándose en los límites vigentes en forma..."},{"kind":"text","t":48261.898557,"text":"According to the leaked information, the document will address the border conflict that Palestine aims to resolve based on the current borders in a certain manner..."},{"kind":"audio","t":48321.29431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":48326.139091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48331.416287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48336.561654,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":48341.965618,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48347.193895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48351.397215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48353.370496999996,"samples":24424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":49806.333093,"text":"previa a la guerra del medio oriente de 1967."},{"kind":"text","t":50019.544938,"text":"prior to the 1967 Middle East war."},{"kind":"audio","t":50053.652667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50058.474299,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50063.041274,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":58654.593049,"text":"la capital de moldavia es chinchiná su lengua regional es rumano aunque ruso también es muy hablado"},{"kind":"text","t":59045.35704,"text":"The capital of Moldova is Chisinau. Its regional language is Romanian, although Russian is also widely spoken."},{"kind":"audio","t":59089.839093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59094.711595,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":59095.471024,"samples":10664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":59119.875589999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59124.789181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":59129.976646999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59135.338362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":59135.780635999996,"samples":8728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71967.334265,"text":"Entre las demás nominaciones se encuentran Mejor Película, Mejor Director, Mejor Cinematografía, Mejor Diseño de Vestuario, Mejor Edición de Películas."},{"kind":"text","t":72365.301894,"text":"Among the other nominations are Best Picture, Best Director, Best Cinematography, Best Costuming, and Best Film Editing."},{"kind":"audio","t":72419.034787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72424.102335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72429.096755,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72434.254412,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72439.508318,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72444.954151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72446.728406,"samples":16392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":78578.023777,"text":"mejor partitura original, mejor diseño de producción, mejor edición de sonido, mejor mezcla de sonido y mejor guión original."},{"kind":"text","t":78930.205241,"text":"Best Original Score, Best Production Design, Best Sound Editing, Best Sound Mixing, and Best Original Screenplay."},{"kind":"audio","t":78981.298851,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78986.639846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78991.93105099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78996.98614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79002.359034,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":79007.078068,"samples":31760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":710},{"kind":"input","t":86486.115957,"text":"Previo al arribo de las fuerzas de paz, Haití no había enfrentado problemas asociados a la enfermedad desde el siglo XIX."},{"kind":"text","t":86867.297883,"text":"Before the arrival of peacekeeping forces, Haiti had not faced disease-related problems since the 19th century."},{"kind":"audio","t":86919.648735,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86924.886081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":86930.091668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86935.488772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86940.927315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86946.547346,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":86946.716304,"samples":3792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94260.460503,"text":"A dos años del final de la guerra, los que eran aliados ahora eran enemigos y la Guerra Fría comenzó."},{"kind":"text","t":94624.500101,"text":"Two years before the end of the war, those who were allies became enemies, and the Cold War began."},{"kind":"audio","t":94663.931065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94668.802877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94674.060852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94679.22661,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":94684.508905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":94685.139756,"samples":10160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":102474.092127,"text":"En efecto, es muy difícil de encontrar, incluso si uno estuviera seguro de su existencia. En el interior de la cueva,"},{"kind":"text","t":102844.042871,"text":"Indeed, it is very difficult to find, even if one were certain of its existence. Inside the cave,"},{"kind":"audio","t":102894.969563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102900.286338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":102905.263698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102910.661642,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102912.062362,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":102965.932793,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":102966.668782,"samples":13432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":104679.765921,"text":"El aislamiento es total."},{"kind":"text","t":104795.73540599999,"text":"The isolation is total."},{"kind":"audio","t":104868.626968,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104871.551437,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":114315.431446,"text":"Lamentablemente, no es tarea sencilla estudiar el flujo del tráfico, ya que no es posible hacer predicciones exactas sobre el comportamiento de los conductores."},{"kind":"text","t":114694.414943,"text":"Unfortunately, studying traffic flow isn’t an easy task, as it’s impossible to make accurate predictions about drivers’ behavior."},{"kind":"audio","t":114761.966671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":114766.910631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114772.134447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114777.327934,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114782.58375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":114787.92275499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":114793.137261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":114793.474656,"samples":2224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":124106.459201,"text":"En 2002, la lava del volcán Niragongo destruyó Goma y dejó gran parte de sus calles sumergidas, especialmente en el centro de la ciudad."},{"kind":"text","t":124559.7643,"text":"In 2002, lava from Mount Niragongo destroyed Goma and submerged much of its streets, especially in the city center."},{"kind":"audio","t":124633.211565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124638.50692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124644.055582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124649.223519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124654.595123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":124659.79277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124664.005531,"samples":28392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":130540.31023599999,"text":"Rolando Mendoza abrió fuego con su M16 contra los visitantes extranjeros."},{"kind":"text","t":130808.778341,"text":"Rolando Mendoza opened fire with his M16 at the foreign visitors."},{"kind":"audio","t":130842.27755900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130843.33193399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130844.94218099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":130846.49840899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":130846.866044,"samples":12328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141134.335599,"text":"Si usted no suele conducir por carreteras rurales, manténgase alerta. Existen muchas pendientes pronunciadas, carriles estrechos y curvas cerradas."},{"kind":"text","t":141430.284597,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on rural roads, stay alert. There are many steep slopes, narrow lanes, and tight curves."},{"kind":"audio","t":141475.669847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141481.057201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":141486.355407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":141486.475315,"samples":3096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":141545.500873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141550.819888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141556.281751,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":141556.407619,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152399.542071,"text":"La mayor parte de los telescopios de investigación actuales consisten en inmensas estructuras instaladas en áreas alejadas con condiciones atmosféricas propicias."},{"kind":"text","t":152725.099071,"text":"Most of today’s research telescopes are enormous structures located in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":152791.543105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152796.789421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152802.035317,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152807.337782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152812.476759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152817.691416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152820.771962,"samples":22992,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":161497.326489,"text":"El color del jugo de repollo se verá alterado en función de cuán ácida o básica, alcalina, sea la sustancia química."},{"kind":"text","t":161852.878777,"text":"The color of cabbage juice will change depending on whether the chemical substance is acidic or basic/alkaline."},{"kind":"audio","t":161903.546912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161908.780519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":161914.044814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161919.28843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":161924.398408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":161929.104742,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":169582.363375,"text":"Dado que el cielo se mantendrá oscuro casi durante todo el día, es una gran oportunidad para contemplar las auroras boreales."},{"kind":"text","t":169947.749734,"text":"Since the sky will remain dark for almost the entire day, it’s a great opportunity to observe the Northern Lights."},{"kind":"audio","t":169999.332987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170004.11536999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170009.380905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1080},{"kind":"audio","t":170014.529293,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170019.844378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170023.983609,"samples":28760,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":176356.472383,"text":"Por tanto, es probable que la anotación haya sido agregada tan solo como un rótulo."},{"kind":"text","t":176595.01834,"text":"Therefore, it’s likely the annotation was added merely as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":176653.807671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176659.106177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":176664.297184,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176667.346601,"samples":22896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":184250.854677,"text":"Los parisinos tienen reputación de egocéntricos, descorteses y engreídos."},{"kind":"text","t":184515.064492,"text":"Parisians have a reputation for being egocentric, rude, and arrogant."},{"kind":"audio","t":184561.32867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184566.197651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184571.24767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184576.426497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":184576.699673,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":191453.13105999999,"text":"El curry es una receta a base de hierbas y especias y que se sirve con carne o vegetales."},{"kind":"text","t":191732.456092,"text":"Curry is a recipe made with herbs and spices, served with meat or vegetables."},{"kind":"audio","t":191766.912806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191772.128512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191777.221081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":191782.418157,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":191783.688779,"samples":11728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":202705.551902,"code":1005}]}